&auto=format&fit=crop\",\"stock\":10,\"version\":1},{\"id\":\"7\",\"title\":\"The Hitchhiker's Guide to the API\",\"author\":\"Douglas Adams\",\"price\":11.5,\"genre\":\"Sci-Fi\",\"description\":\"The answer to life, the universe, and REST endpoints is 42.\",\"image\":\"https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1462331940025-496dfbfc7564%3Fq=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\",\"stock\":10,\"version\":1},{\"id\":\"8\",\"title\":\"Moby Stack Overflow\",\"author\":\"Herman Melville\",\"price\":8.99,\"genre\":\"Classic\",\"description\":\"Captain Ahab's obsessive pursuit of the white stack trace.\",\"image\":\"https%3A%2F%2Fimages.unsplash.com%2Fphoto-1623018035782-b269248df916%3Fq=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\",\"stock\":10,\"version\":1}],\"total\":15,\"page\":1,\"totalPages\":2,\"limit\":8}"
